WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.445
The admin is where you manage your Orchard Core site:

00:00:04.445 --> 00:00:07.189
its content, design, users, and settings.

00:00:07.189 --> 00:00:11.743
In this video, let's tour the admin of a site made with the Blog recipe:

00:00:11.743 --> 00:00:16.530
the start page, the menu, the breadcrumb, quick navigation, and the top bar.

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:23.867
Every admin page has the same three parts.

00:00:23.867 --> 00:00:27.573
The top bar holds your tools, the menu on the left leads to

00:00:27.573 --> 00:00:31.507
the other pages, and the rest of the screen is the page itself,

00:00:31.507 --> 00:00:33.560
with its breadcrumb and title.

00:00:34.310 --> 00:00:38.198
The admin has its own theme, called The Admin Theme, which is separate

00:00:38.198 --> 00:00:39.937
from the theme of your site.

00:00:39.937 --> 00:00:43.620
Only users who have the Access admin panel permission can open it.

00:00:47.771 --> 00:00:52.047
By default, you reach the admin by adding Admin to the address of

00:00:52.047 --> 00:00:53.914
your site and signing in.

00:00:53.914 --> 00:00:57.889
Its start page welcomes you, and cards link to common tasks:

00:00:57.889 --> 00:01:01.261
Create content, Customize theme, and Manage users.

00:01:01.768 --> 00:01:04.826
The Learn more card links to the documentation.

00:01:04.826 --> 00:01:09.038
Its Documentation button opens the documentation in a separate tab.

00:01:09.530 --> 00:01:12.572
The logo and the site name in the top bar bring you back

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:14.830
to this page from anywhere in the admin.

00:01:19.130 --> 00:01:23.055
The menu on the left has a section for each area of your

00:01:23.055 --> 00:01:27.677
site, such as Content, Design, Access Control, Tools, and Settings.

00:01:27.677 --> 00:01:31.350
Features you enable add their own pages to the menu.

00:01:32.893 --> 00:01:35.513
Let's open Content, and then Design.

00:01:35.513 --> 00:01:41.003
By default, opening a section closes the others, so one section is open at a time.

00:01:41.473 --> 00:01:43.922
Open Content, and then Content Items.

00:01:43.922 --> 00:01:47.910
When the page loads, the menu marks it and opens its section, so

00:01:47.910 --> 00:01:49.733
you can see where you are.

00:01:50.185 --> 00:01:53.549
The menu shows only the pages that your user may open.

00:01:53.549 --> 00:01:57.865
A user with fewer permissions sees fewer entries than an administrator.

00:01:58.316 --> 00:02:03.538
Blog and Main Menu are links from a custom admin menu that the Blog recipe created.

00:02:03.538 --> 00:02:06.766
Under Tools, Admin Menus, you can build your own.

00:02:07.218 --> 00:02:10.892
The button at the bottom of the menu collapses it to icons.

00:02:10.892 --> 00:02:14.905
Hover over an icon to see its section, and click the button again

00:02:14.905 --> 00:02:16.318
to expand the menu.

00:02:20.552 --> 00:02:24.613
The Content Items page lists the content items of your site, such as

00:02:24.613 --> 00:02:26.259
articles and blog posts.

00:02:26.259 --> 00:02:29.716
In the menu it is Content Items, and the title at the top

00:02:29.716 --> 00:02:31.692
of the page is Manage Content.

00:02:32.146 --> 00:02:34.250
Let's open the About article.

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:38.099
Above its title, the breadcrumb shows where the page sits:

00:02:38.099 --> 00:02:41.286
Manage Content, Article, and then Edit Article.

00:02:41.753 --> 00:02:44.726
Each earlier step of the breadcrumb is a link.

00:02:44.726 --> 00:02:47.583
Click Manage Content to go back to the list.

00:02:51.797 --> 00:02:56.433
Quick navigation opens a palette, a search box for the pages of the menu.

00:02:56.433 --> 00:02:59.837
Press Ctrl+K, or click the magnifier in the top bar.

00:03:00.287 --> 00:03:02.906
Type part of a page name, such as user.

00:03:02.906 --> 00:03:07.329
The palette lists the matching pages, and under each name it shows the

00:03:07.329 --> 00:03:09.307
sections that hold the page.

00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:12.677
Move through the results with the arrow keys.

00:03:12.677 --> 00:03:16.950
The Esc key closes the palette, and Enter opens the highlighted page.

00:03:21.140 --> 00:03:24.939
By default, the palette lists only the pages of the menu.

00:03:24.939 --> 00:03:29.040
The Content Quick Navigation feature adds content items to it.

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:33.260
On the Features page, under Tools, type quick in the Search box.

00:03:33.723 --> 00:03:35.180
Click Enable on its row.

00:03:35.180 --> 00:03:37.803
A message confirms that the feature was enabled.

00:03:38.669 --> 00:03:41.207
Press Ctrl+K and type the word about.

00:03:41.207 --> 00:03:44.631
The About article appears, with Content as its path.

00:03:44.631 --> 00:03:48.409
The palette lists only items that you are allowed to edit.

00:03:48.873 --> 00:03:54.206
By default, the palette considers the last 50 content items that were updated.

00:03:54.206 --> 00:04:00.683
The option Recent content items in quick navigation, under Settings, Admin, changes that number.

00:04:01.146 --> 00:04:05.273
The same page holds the other options of the admin, such as Enable

00:04:05.273 --> 00:04:09.629
theme toggler, Enable Admin Menu filter, and Navigation menu behavior.

00:04:09.629 --> 00:04:11.636
A separate video covers them.

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:19.475
In the top bar, Visit Site opens the front end of your site

00:04:19.475 --> 00:04:22.710
in the same tab, so you can see what a visitor sees.

00:04:23.175 --> 00:04:27.297
Back in the admin, the theme toggle offers Auto, Light, and Dark.

00:04:27.297 --> 00:04:31.942
Auto follows the setting of your device, and Dark changes the whole admin.

00:04:31.942 --> 00:04:34.265
Your browser remembers the choice.

00:04:34.716 --> 00:04:37.025
Your user menu shows who is signed in.

00:04:37.025 --> 00:04:40.856
It links to your profile and lets you change your password, and Log

00:04:40.856 --> 00:04:42.326
off ends your session.

00:04:46.526 --> 00:04:47.431
In short:

00:04:47.431 --> 00:04:51.837
the menu leads to the pages, quick navigation finds a page by name,

00:04:51.837 --> 00:04:56.606
the breadcrumb leads back up, and the logo returns you to the start page.

00:04:58.606 --> 00:05:00.383
That's the Orchard Core admin:

00:05:00.383 --> 00:05:04.581
a menu that follows your permissions, quick navigation from the keyboard, and a

00:05:04.581 --> 00:05:06.062
top bar with your tools.

00:05:06.062 --> 00:05:07.346
Thanks for watching.

